<title>USA: Applied Voice Q2 VoiceCOMMANDER sales up.</title>
<headline>Applied Voice Q2 VoiceCOMMANDER sales up.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Voice Recognition Inc on Wednesday said it had a 235 per cent increase in sales of its flagship product VoiceCOMMANDER for the second quarter of 1997 compared with the same quarter in 1996.</p>
<p>Applied Voice develops voice-centric automated speech recognition products.</p>
